	<diy-instructions lang="en-GB">
1. Extract all files into thier proper folders
2. Go to Administration Panel > System > Module Management: Administration Control Panel
3. Use the dropdown/dropbox at the bottom of the page to Add a new module named "Inactive Users MOD"
4. On the next page, confirm that you want to add this module; then be sure to Enable the module by clicking on "Enable"
5. The module has now been added, and you should now move it to a more suitable location using Module Management.
6. To move the module, click on the little green cog in front of "Inactive Users MOD," and on the next page, change it's Parent to whatever you want.
- For example, Users, under the Users and Groups category.
	</diy-instructions>
